==== OEM easy installation ====
This is the preferred method. Download the DLF file linked in the table above.

In the web administration interface of the device (by default at ''%%http://192.168.0.1%%'', click "Tools", then "Firmware". On the firmware upgrade page, choose the DLF file you downloaded earlier, then click "Apply". Your ESR900 will reboot into OpenWrt, and you will then be able to access the device via telnet at 192.168.1.1.

